## Review procedure

1. Read `.agent-docs/integration-vr-backend.md` and `70-backend-sync.mdc`
2. Diff only files matching `globs`
3. Run `python tools/ci/validate_security_surface.py`
4. Audit each vector V1–V6 with file:line evidence
5. Output findings table sorted by severity
6. If `[CRITICAL]` or `[HIGH]` > 0 → **DO NOT MERGE**

---

## Bugbot coordination

When `/review-bugbot` runs on the same diff, Bugbot focuses on correctness/regressions; this rule adds security vectors V1–V6. Both reviews required for adapter/sync changes.

Launch:

```text
/review-security
Review branch changes per 80-security-review.mdc vectors V1–V6.

/review-bugbot
Review branch changes for logic bugs in sync queue and adapter error paths.
```

---

## Key files

| Path | Risk |
|------|------|
| `Assets/SafeMining/LOTOSimulation/Code/Adapters/` | HTTP, auth headers, timeouts |
| `Assets/SafeMining/LOTOSimulation/Code/Data/LotoSessionScore.cs` | Score integrity |
| `Assets/SafeMining/LOTOSimulation/Code/Data/SimulationResultPayload.cs` | Payload schema |
| `Assets/XR Standard Menu/Code/LOTOSimulation/Managers/SyncQueueManager.cs` | Queue races, data loss |
| `Assets/XR Standard Menu/Code/Managers/IBManager.cs` | Legacy endpoint — read-only |

---

## NEVER

1. Log tokens, JWTs, or passwords
2. Store credentials in PlayerPrefs without encryption
3. Block gameplay on network failure
4. Delete local scores on sync failure
5. Send PII beyond session identifiers
6. Modify IBManager legacy path without explicit approval
